<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Compaq purchase of Tandem.</title>
<headline>EU clears Compaq purchase of Tandem.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Tuesday said it has given clearance to the acquisition by U.S. computer maker Compaq Computer Corporation of the whole of Tandem Computers.</p>
<p>The EU executive said that it found the &quot;overlaps between the two companies' activities...were not such as to give rise to competition concerns.&quot;</p>
<p>Compaq is one of the world's largest suppliers of computer products.</p>
<p>Tandem is a U.S.-based supplier of highly specialised computer processing systems for operations in banks, stock exchanges and telecommunications.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
